---
name: Return created
section: Returns
subject: Your return for order {{ order.name }}
---
{%- assign mk_delivery = return.deliveries | first -%}
{%- assign mk_label_url = mk_delivery.return_label.public_file_url -%}
{%- capture email_title -%}
  {%- if mk_label_url != blank -%}Your return label is ready{%- else -%}Your return is set up{%- endif -%}
{%- endcapture -%}
{%- capture email_preheader -%}Here's how to send your return for order {{ order.name }}.{%- endcapture -%}
{%- assign mk_eyebrow = 'Order ' | append: order.name -%}
<!-- body -->
<p style="%%p%%">
  {%- if mk_label_url != blank -%}
    We've set up your return. Print the label below and attach it to the parcel, covering any old labels.
  {%- elsif mk_delivery.type == 'manual' -%}
    We've set up your return. We've sent you a return label, or you'll have it soon. Once it arrives, attach it to the parcel and hand it to the courier.
  {%- else -%}
    We've set up your return. Here's how to send it back.
  {%- endif -%}
</p>

{%- if mk_label_url != blank %}
  {%- assign mk_button_url = mk_label_url -%}
  {%- assign mk_button_label = 'Print return label' -%}
  {%- assign mk_link_url = order.order_status_url -%}
  {%- assign mk_link_label = 'view your order' -%}
{%- else %}
  {%- assign mk_button_url = order.order_status_url | default: mk_site -%}
  {%- assign mk_button_label = 'View your order' -%}
{%- endif %}
{% render 'button' %}

{%- if mk_label_url == blank and mk_delivery.type != 'manual' %}
{% render 'return-send-to' %}
{%- endif %}

{%- assign mk_section = 'Returning' -%}
{% render 'section-start' %}
{% render 'return-items' %}
{% render 'section-end' %}
